@junit | admin-directory-run | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0
@junit | admin-directory-delete | 1 | 0 | 0 | 1 | 2
# Pulling the chosen servers' newest posts (pulling on; the day's count was read at start): the
# instance key, whether the server is blocked, when the newest post kept from it was written; then
# per new post its author (lookup, suspended-server check and instance key before the fetch, lookup
